{"seq":93,"slug":"game-procedural-dungeon","title":"程序化地牢生成","stage":"DONE","category":"game-development","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-procedural-dungeon","rating":{"composite":4.38,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.6,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":4.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 程序化地牢生成\n\n程序化地牢生成是 Roguelike 类型游戏的灵魂技术，也是近年来独立游戏与 3A 开放世界的核心基础设施。每一次运行，算法从一枚种子数字出发，经过空间分割、连通性验证、内容分配，生成一个玩家从未见过、却又感觉精心设计的关卡——这背后是几十年 Roguelike 社区积累的算法谱系：BSP、Drunkard Walk、Cellular Automata、Wave Function Collapse，以及图论驱动的关键路锁钥系统。\n\n本 hub 面向已具备基础数据结构（图、栈、队列）和线性代数知识的中级游戏程序员，聚焦程序化地牢生成的算法原理与工程落地。通用 PCG 理论（L-System、Grammar 等）见 `hubs/11_computer-graphics/procedural-content-generation`；手工关卡设计方法论（节拍曲线、叙事结构）见 `hubs/10_game-design/level-design`；空间查询加速结构（四叉树、BVH）见 `hubs/16_game-development/88_game-spatial-data-structures`。\n\n**第1章《生成基础》** 建立地牢生成的通用框架：生成方法的分类谱系（空间分割/基于形状/基于图/基于代理），房间-走廊拓扑的图论建模（Delaunay 三角剖分 + MST 主干 + 部分边形成环路），以及可达性验证与关键路-锁钥系统，是理解所有后续算法的概念基础。\n\n**第2章《核心算法》** 深入三大经典算法的实现细节：BSP 树递归空间分割产生规整迷宫，Cellular Automata 模拟自然洞穴的涌现结构，Wave Function Collapse 通过约束传播生成局部连贯的大型关卡。每个算法都覆盖原理、实现、参数调优与典型缺陷。\n\n**第3章《设计集成》** 连接算法输出与玩家体验：难度曲线与节奏控制（关键路径长度、Rest-Fight-Rest 节拍），主题化与装饰系统（Tileset 切换、Biome 系统、装饰密度函数），以及 Spawn Table 驱动的遭遇与战利品布置（CR-like Encounter Budget、Boss 房间布局）。\n\n**第4章《工程实践》** 覆盖生产环境中的工程问题：确定性 PRNG 与种子管理（PCG64/xorshift128+），Chunk-Based 流式生成与无限地牢（边界缝合协议），以及程序化内容的属性测试策略（100% 可达性验证、回归种子库）。\n\n推荐顺序：第1章建立框架概念后，可按需跳读——第2章算法实现相互独立，第3章设计话题相互独立；第4章工程话题在实际项目落地时按需参考。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"fundamentals","title":"生成基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-procedural-dungeon/fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"generation-methods-overview","title":"生成方法概览","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-procedural-dungeon/fundamentals/generation-methods-overview"},{"seq":2,"slug":"room-corridor-topology","title":"房间走廊拓扑","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-procedural-dungeon/fundamentals/room-corridor-topology"},{"seq":3,"slug":"constraint-validation","title":"约束与有效性验证","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-procedural-dungeon/fundamentals/constraint-validation"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"algorithms","title":"核心算法","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-procedural-dungeon/algorithms","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"bsp-space-partitioning","title":"BSP 空间分割","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-procedural-dungeon/algorithms/bsp-space-partitioning"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cellular-automata","title":"细胞自动机","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-procedural-dungeon/algorithms/cellular-automata"},{"seq":3,"slug":"wave-function-collapse","title":"波函数坍缩","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-procedural-dungeon/algorithms/wave-function-collapse"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"design","title":"设计集成","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-procedural-dungeon/design","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"difficulty-rhythm","title":"难度与节奏控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-procedural-dungeon/design/difficulty-rhythm"},{"seq":2,"slug":"theme-decoration","title":"主题与装饰","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-procedural-dungeon/design/theme-decoration"},{"seq":3,"slug":"encounter-loot","title":"遭遇与战利品布置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-procedural-dungeon/design/encounter-loot"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"engineering","title":"工程实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-procedural-dungeon/engineering","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"seed-reproducibility","title":"种子与可复现性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-procedural-dungeon/engineering/seed-reproducibility"},{"seq":2,"slug":"streaming-generation","title":"流式生成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-procedural-dungeon/engineering/streaming-generation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"pcg-testing","title":"程序化内容测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-procedural-dungeon/engineering/pcg-testing"}]}]}